          "scene": {
            "concept": "the Phantasmal Flames expansion",
            "ground_noun": "forest floor",
            "lighting": "Copper sunset light meets cool blue twilight from the upper sky.",
            "rendering": "Use dramatic but readable cel-painted linework, controlled warm-cool contrast, and layered smoky depth.",
            "setting": "The artwork contains a dusky volcanic woodland with dark basalt shelves, distant warm vents, pale spectral mist between the trees, and faint flame-like cloud forms confined to the far background."
